<title>FRANCE: Blocks of two pct in Casino traded.</title>
<headline>Blocks of two pct in Casino traded.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Two blocks representing in total some two percent of the shares in Casino were traded on Monday, dealers said.</p>
<p>They said there was one block of 649,000 shares traded at 293.30 francs per share and another the same day at 293.00 francs.</p>
<p>Casino closed down 0.24 percent at 287 francs.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
